WEBVTT

00:04:25.876 --> 00:04:30.369
(Applause)

00:04:31.256 --> 00:04:33.759
At the polling stations last year,

00:04:33.783 --> 00:04:37.686
my three-year-old daughter,
Amina, was in my arm.

00:04:38.591 --> 00:04:43.156
She insisted on holding on to
my ballot paper with me.

00:04:44.298 --> 00:04:46.898
She was intent and focused.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.743
At that moment,

00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:52.913
with my ballot papers in both our hands,

00:04:52.937 --> 00:04:56.614
I fully understood the one priority for me

00:04:56.638 --> 00:04:59.989
if I was elected president
of the Republic of Sierra Leone;